        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "MR or CT enterography"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (high-resolution imaging w lrg volumes of ingested contrast) are the procedures of choice; virtually diagnostic if they show characteristic "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
